     A          R PEXA01                    TEXT('Exp Mod Import File')
     A            EXFORMAT       1A         COLHDG('Format')
     A* Valid Values:
     A* H = Header
     A* D = Detail
     A* T = Trailer
     A            EX#OFRECS      9A         COLHDG('# of Records')
     A* # of Records is used with the H format
     A            EXFND          3A         COLHDG('Group')
     A            EXEMP#         9A         COLHDG('Employer #')
     A            EXDIV          5A         COLHDG('Division')
     A            EXFYR          3A         COLHDG('Policy Year')
     A            EXMOD          6A         COLHDG('Experience Mod')
     A* Mod Format X.XXXX
     A            EXEFDT         8A         COLHDG('Effective Date')
     A* Date Format YYYMMDD
     A            EXARAP         6A         COLHDG('ARAP Factor')
     A* ARAP Format X.XXXX
     A            EXNOTFIN       1A         COLHDG('Not final Flag')
     A* Not Final Valid values are Y and Blank
     A            EXFILL        59A         COLHDG('Filler')
     A* Space provided in case of the addition of new fields
     A            EXRCDERROR     1A         COLHDG('Record Error')
     A* If Y error found on record
